  "body_text": "Dr Emilie Delpuech\n        Publications list:2022Delpuech E., Vandeputte M., Morvezen R. and Allal F. \"Whole-genome sequencing identifies interferon induced protein IFI6 as a strong candidate gene for VNN resistance in European sea bass\".BioRxiv(2022). https://doi.org/10.1101/2022.05.31.4942092021Delpuech E., Aliakbari A., Labrune Y. et al. \"Identification of genomic regions affecting production traits in pigs divergently selected for feed efficiency\". Genet Sel Evol (2021). https://doi.org/10.1186/s12711-021-00642-12020Aliakbari A., Delpuech E., Labrune Y. et al. \"The impact of training on data from genetically-related lines on the accuracy of genomic predictions for feed efficiency traits in pigs\". Genet Sel Evol (2020). https://doi.org/10.1186/s12711-020-00576-0\n\nLet’s discuss your project\n        \n        Do you wish to implement biodiversity monitoring, study a population, or develop a specific molecular tool ?\n    \n                Contact our team",
